      </div>
      <p class="vs-body-text" style="max-width:64ch; margin-bottom:24px;">
        GSAP library lives in <code>src/scripts/animations.js</code>. Every effect is
        matchMedia-gated to honor <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code>. Hover systems (button +
        service-card + standalone arrow) work in both modes.
      </p>

      <table class="ds-motion-table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Hook</th><th>What it does</th><th>Where</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr
            ><td><code>data-vs-reveal</code></td><td
              >24px rise + fade · 0.6s power2.out · "top 85%" once</td
            ><td>Cards, image frames, body sections</td></tr
          >
          <tr
            ><td><code>data-vs-reveal-lines</code></td><td
              >Per-line mask reveal · yPercent 110→0 + blur 10→0 · 1.6s expo.out · stagger 0.12</td
            ><td>H1/H2/H3</td></tr
          >
          <tr
            ><td><code>data-vs-reveal-batch</code></td><td
              >Staggered child reveal · y50 + scale .97 + blur 6 → full · 1.4s · stagger 0.14</td
            ><td>Grids of cards</td></tr
          >
          <tr
            ><td><code>data-vs-parallax</code> + <code>data-parallax</code></td><td
              >y drift on scroll · ease none · scrub 0.5 · desktop only</td
            ><td>Image-frame insets</td></tr
          >
          <tr
            ><td><code>data-vs-counter</code> + <code>data-target</code></td><td
              >0 → target count-up · 2.0s expo.out · "top 92%"</td
            ><td>Credential numbers</td></tr
          >
          <tr
            ><td><code>data-vs-arrow</code> (+ flags <code>magnetic</code>, <code>ripple</code>)</td
            ><td
              >Canonical knock-up + swap on any host with a descendant <code
                >&lt;ArrowBadge&gt;</code
              > · arrow scale 1.08 rotate -45° · main glyph translates 130% out, ghost glyph translates
              in · 0.55s expo.out · <code>magnetic</code> adds mousemove translate + 1.025 host scale
              · <code>ripple</code> adds click ripple</td
            ><td
              >Buttons (magnetic ripple), service cards, standalone cards, mega-menu cards, contact
              cards</td
            ></tr
          >
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 13 LOCAL TRUST SECTION -->
  <section class="vs-band-cream">
