        left (no API key, uses <code>output=embed</code>), per-page body + reviews summary (300+
        five-star) + address + Book/Directions CTAs on the right. Map sits in a <code>vs-r-xl</code> framed
        wrapper with shadow, 4:5 aspect on desktop, 4:3 then 1:1 as the viewport narrows. Collapses to
        a single stacked column at 991px, matching the project's tablet breakpoint.
      </p>
      <p class="vs-body-text" style="max-width:64ch; margin-bottom:18px;">
        <strong>Props:</strong>
        <code>heading</code> (h2, required), <code>eyebrow</code> (default "Our Practice"), <code
          >intro</code
        > (centered lede, optional), <code>body</code> (right-column paragraph; omit to render the default
