          >background</code
        > (<code>cream</code> | <code>paper</code>, default <code>cream</code>), <code>ctas</code> (array
        of <code>&lcub;label, href, variant?, hoverLabel?&rcub;</code>; defaults to Book Online +
        Get Directions), <code>note</code> (replaces the practice address with a single-line caption,
        e.g. "Real cases · Real Vivid Smiles patients").
      </p>
    </div>
    <LocalTrust
      heading="Veneers Designed"
